\f0\b \cf0 \strokec2 Pro Tip: Create a Universal List
\f1\b0 \
Build a universal negative keyword list with terms that should NEVER trigger ads in any campaign across your account. Examples:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls3\ilvl0\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 "used" (if you don't sell used products)\
