\fs24 \cf0 Quick Win
\f1\b0 : Exclude all mobile apps immediately to save budget.\
A guy named Nils created a comprehensive list of mobile app categories that you can use. This list is available in the Skool community (shout out to Nils for sharing this).\uc0\u8232 \u8232 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1bRYe0QyrrUa8qRxRFZ773yW050Gap2b-F74ip20Qh24/edit?usp=sharing"}}{\fldrslt \cf4 \ul \ulc4 \strokec4 https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1bRYe0QyrrUa8qRxRFZ773yW050Gap2b-F74ip20Qh24/edit?usp=sharing}}\

